  "result": "Excellent! The refactoring is complete and successful. Here's what was accomplished:\n\n## Summary\n\n**Created src/totals.js** \u2014 A new module containing four functions focused on invoice line and invoice total calculations:\n- `lineTotal(line)` \u2014 Calculates qty \u00d7 unitPrice\n- `lineDiscount(line)` \u2014 Calculates line discount percentage\n- `lineVat(line)` \u2014 Calculates VAT on amount after discount\n- `invoiceTotals(invoice)` \u2014 Calculates subtotal, discount, VAT, voucher, and total\n\n**Updated src/invoices.js** \u2014 Refactored to:\n- Import the four functions from src/totals.js (line 6)\n- Re-export them for backward compatibility (line 8)\n- Removed ~55 lines of function definitions\n\n**Created test/totals.test.js** \u2014 Comprehensive test suite with 41 tests covering:\n- All calculation edge cases (0%, 100%, decimals)\n- Rounding and clamping behavior\n- Single and multiple lines with discounts and VAT\n- Voucher application\n- Immutability verification\n\n**Backward Compatibility** \u2014 Fully maintained:\n- All functions can still be imported from `src/invoices.js`\n- Existing tests that import from `src/invoices.js` continue to pass\n- No breaking changes to the public API\n\n**Test Results:** All 313 tests pass (272 original + 41 new totals tests).",
